commit ae74c68535081df2b995c5ebbf906503f1f6d2ab

C03: the demuxer's reader position verifies a YouTube playback when the audio clock stays at zero (MUSIC1569)

MUSIC1567 measured, with mpv's own log, that every playback started (stream opened, AAC decoder and WASAPI running, «audio=playing») and that six of seven were reported unverified because time-pos never advanced: on this laptop the WASAPI clock can stay at zero while the audio is consumed (root probe: time-pos ≈ 0.0001 for thirty seconds, demuxer reader-pts advancing in real time, a --length=3 run ending on time). YouTubeMpvAdapter now also reads demuxer-cache-state.reader-pts and verifies the playback when either clock advances half a second unpaused; the receipt records which clock proved it (progressClock).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


